---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout>
  <div class="wrap hero hero-new">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Built for agencies and solo operators</span>
      <h1>Design safer workflows <span class="gradient">before you automate.</span></h1>
      <p>Turn client onboarding, lead follow-up and weekly reporting into documented automation blueprints—with approval gates, failure handling, verification and practical test cases.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/builder/">Build a free blueprint <span>↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/sample/">See a real sample</a></div>
      <div class="micro"><span class="micro-dot"></span> Free to use · No sign-up · Runs in your browser</div>
      <div class="hero-proof"><span>01 <b>Describe</b></span><span>02 <b>Design</b></span><span>03 <b>Export</b></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-product" aria-label="Illustration of a generated automation workflow">
      <div class="product-window-top"><span class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>WORKFLOW STUDIO</span><span class="pill">LOCAL PREVIEW</span></div>
      <div class="product-window-body">
        <div class="mini-trigger"><small>TRIGGER</small><strong>New client signs</strong></div><div class="mini-link">↓</div>
        <div class="mini-node"><span>01</span><div><strong>Validate client details</strong><small>Required fields · Duplicate check</small></div><b>✓</b></div><div class="mini-link">↓</div>
        <div class="mini-node"><span>02</span><div><strong>Create project workspace</strong><small>Template · Owner · Due dates</small></div><b>↗</b></div><div class="mini-link">↓</div>
        <div class="mini-node mini-approval"><span>03</span><div><strong>Human review</strong><small>Approve external communication</small></div><b>◇</b></div><div class="mini-link">↓</div>
        <div class="mini-done"><span>✓</span><div><strong>Verify & record outcome</strong><small>Success only after confirmation</small></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="product-window-bottom"><span><i></i> Blueprint ready to customize</span><span>JSON + Markdown</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section feature-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">More than a checklist</span><h2>A blueprint you can put to work.</h2></div><p>Plan the process, anticipate failure and hand a clear spec to the person building your automation.</p></div>
    <div class="cards feature-cards">
      <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">⌘</div><h3>Visual workflow map</h3><p>See the trigger, each action, decision points and verification step in a connected sequence.</p><a class="text-link" href="/builder/">Design a workflow →</a></article>
      <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">↳</div><h3>Build and recovery plan</h3><p>Get tool-mapping suggestions, human approval rules, duplicate-event safeguards and failure handling.</p><a class="text-link" href="/builder/">Create a build plan →</a></article>
      <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">↓</div><h3>Portable deliverables</h3><p>Export structured JSON for your own tooling or Markdown to share with a teammate or developer.</p><a class="text-link" href="/builder/">Generate an export →</a></article>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section usecase-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Start with a common use case</span><h2>Designed for real operational friction.</h2></div><p>Start from a common pattern, then customize it for your business and chosen tools.</p></div>
    <div class="usecase-grid"><a href="/builder/" class="usecase"><span>01 / CLIENT OPERATIONS</span><strong>Onboard every client consistently</strong><small>Intake → workspace → approvals → handoff ↗</small></a><a href="/builder/" class="usecase"><span>02 / SALES</span><strong>Follow up with new leads</strong><small>Capture → validate → assign → follow-up ↗</small></a><a href="/builder/" class="usecase"><span>03 / CONTENT</span><strong>Move content from brief to review</strong><small>Brief → draft → approval → publish ↗</small></a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="banner"><div><h2>Start with the process. Build with confidence.</h2><p>Get a practical blueprint, then test it before connecting live systems.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/sample/">View sample output ↗</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section resource-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Learn the foundations</span><h2>Better workflows start with better thinking.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/guides/">Browse all guides →</a></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><div class="card-icon">◎</div><h3>Find the first process to automate</h3><p>Choose a repetitive, measurable task with clear inputs and outcomes.</p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/first-workflow-to-automate/">Read guide →</a></article><article class="card"><div class="card-icon">⛨</div><h3>Design safer AI workflows</h3><p>Keep permissions, approval gates and failure handling in the design.</p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/safer-ai-workflows/">Read guide →</a></article><article class="card"><div class="card-icon">↗</div><h3>Make client onboarding repeatable</h3><p>Turn the first few days of a client relationship into a reliable process.</p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/client-onboarding-process/">Read guide →</a></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="banner"><div><span class="eyebrow">Launch notes</span><h2>Get the Agency Starter Pack update.</h2><p>Leave your email if you want to hear when tested workflow packs are ready. Email delivery is not yet automated.</p></div><form id="lead-form" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;min-width:min(100%,330px)"><label for="lead-email" class="notice" style="width:100%">Email address</label><input id="lead-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254" placeholder="you@company.com" style="min-width:210px;flex:1;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#0c111a;color:#eaf0ff" /><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Keep me updated ↗</button><label class="notice" style="width:100%;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start"><input type="checkbox" id="lead-consent" required style="margin-top:3px" /> I agree to receive occasional product launch updates. I can ask to be removed.</label><p id="lead-status" class="notice" role="status" style="width:100%;margin:0"></p></form></div></div></section>
  <script>
    const leadForm = document.querySelector("#lead-form");
    leadForm?.addEventListener("submit", async event => {
      event.preventDefault();
      const status = document.querySelector("#lead-status");
      status.textContent = "Submitting…";
      try {
        const response = await fetch("/api/leads", { method: "POST", headers: { "content-type": "application/json" }, body: JSON.stringify({ email: document.querySelector("#lead-email").value, consent: document.querySelector("#lead-consent").checked, source: "homepage" }) });
        const data = await response.json();
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error(data.error || "Signup could not be saved.");
        status.textContent = data.message || "Thanks for your interest.";
        leadForm.reset();
      } catch (error) { status.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "Signup could not be saved."; }
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
